<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-14T06:20:04.354Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:20:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi forces continue air operations against ISIS hideouts in Kirkuk, using F-16 jets, while the government raised military readiness to the highest level and prioritized air defence amid regional tensions. The supreme court declared the Kurdistan Region security law unconstitutional and the Iraqi cabinet is being completed in a Thursday parliament session. Iraq detained 74 border infiltrators and advanced a security wall, and Prime Minister Barzani discussed security and investment with U.S. Consul General Wendy Green. The Iraqi National Security Advisor presented a strategic neutrality stance at MERI 2026. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE9uaHJ1WVYwWGVnOGJjblZNc0FTZnptZ1FZYXNvWXdhVkdnSGR2SlpxTU5meEdOOEFaQkJJekxZZHlzdjZZQ2ZrZ0Z2RFFkaGQzTVhmMnJabW5OWnRTR3JnSGt3a19QVkRSTlhpMlFsQzNIVGhqdkI0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Dispatch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE9EMGVUTWF3bWItREtKUUNlWlVub1o1UGEtTGEzZWlxNXJCRk00LVpMdjFXalBINGV0blRQSGxIOHd4d1prM213Zk1YVk1mLWRKTkHSAVdBVV95cUxOQ1ROVm82aXVxWE9RY2duRzA1OVdzZHRsVUU0a05ZdmNqVXZ5R0l5SW9PWnFsb1hGWnBFYTRwUmNzUndkYlg4dFJPcDZVU09DU1o1bFp5dFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Armenpress&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9SRXBieGJFY0dnWHhjakhCRHZmdmQtclZ4QTRiWkEtWDNzZ2JMaDdQY093TUl3NlFMUlAxc0w3WDhpZ3JUdm0tcXVZVnV6eWphWks2TzllajlMNDlJRXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQLWlDUUFQODBfbkVYaW9VMUVfTTFRMVFyZEIwMTdUV1MxdFFJR3pseGZCTWN1dXhqZ056andsempzYUw4VTJfNE9ESXR4dTJ4ZUZ3NHdDci12OG8zQVJIYzNVQUM5M1RkY1pLYlhtUC1RZ3o3enRqbURDV3VXMDVzNmZR?oc=5&quot;&gt;ش